From: NWA50BE OpenWrt Project <noreply@invalid.example>
Subject: [PATCH] busybox: backport 2026 security fixes to 1.37.0
SPDX-License-Identifier: GPL-2.0-only

Keep busybox 1.37.0 and its configuration and add upstream fixes for
CVE-2026-88839 (c2dec52d3), CVE-2026-26157/26158 (3fb6b31c7, 599f5dd8f)
and CVE-2026-38754 (a448b6d5b), plus the Debian-carried list patches
for CVE-2026-38752, 38753 and 38755, which are not merged upstream yet.

